# Bubblewrap writes the whole Android project next to twa-manifest.json. It is
# regenerated from that file, so only the manifest and the store pictures are
# kept. The signing key must NEVER be committed: anyone holding it can publish
# updates as you. Keep it (and its passwords) in a password manager instead.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!twa-manifest.json
!assetlinks.example.json
!store/
!store/**
*.keystore
*.jks
